ser activity on the website. Possible reasons could include technical issues, lack of relevant content, or poor user experience.\n- The website may need a refresh in terms of design, content, or functionality to attract and retain users.\n\n5. Actionable recommendations:\n- Conduct a thorough review of the website to identify any technical issues that may be hindering user activity.\n- Invest in creating valuable and engaging content to attract and retain users.\n- Implement strategies to improve user experience, such as optimizing site speed, simplifying navigation, and enhancing mobile responsiveness.\n- Consider running targeted marketing campaigns to drive traffic to the website and increase user engagement.", prompt_type: nil, response_time_ms: nil, tokens_used: nil, model_used: nil, metadata: %{}, is_regenerated: false, conversation_id: 8, conversation: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :conversation is not loaded>, parent_message_id: nil, parent_message: nil, child_messages: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :child_messages is not loaded>, inserted_at: ~N[2025-07-29 12:59:46], updated_at: ~N[2025-07-29 12:59:46]}, %DashboardGen.Conversations.ConversationMessage{__meta__: #Ecto.Schema.Metadata<:loaded, "conversation_messages">, id: 18, role: "user", content: "what can we do to fix that?", prompt_type: nil, response_time_ms: nil, tokens_used: nil, model_used: nil, metadata: %{}, is_regenerated: false, conversation_id: 8, conversation: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :conversation is not loaded>, parent_message_id: nil, parent_message: nil, child_messages: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :child_messages is not loaded>, inserted_at: ~N[2025-07-29 12:59:56], updated_at: ~N[2025-07-29 12:59:56]}, %DashboardGen.Conversations.ConversationMessage{__meta__: #Ecto.Schema.Metadata<:loaded, "conversation_messages">, id: 19, role: "assistant", content: "**Key Findings and Insights:**\n\n1. BlackRock, Blackstone, Fidelity Investments, Goldman Sachs Private Wealth, and J.P. Morgan Asset Management are all actively engaging in press releases and social media posts to communicate with their audience.\n2. BlackRock and Fidelity Investments have a balanced presence with 10 press releases and social posts each, reflecting a consistent effort in communication.\n3. J.P. Morgan Asset Management is not utilizing social media platforms for communication, which may impact their visibility and engagement with their audience.\n4. Blackstone and Fidelity Investments have recently announced collaborations and fund closures, indicating a strategic focus on partnerships and product development.\n5. Goldman Sachs Private Wealth has released fewer press releases compared to its competitors, potentially impacting its visibility and market presence.\n\n**Strategic Implications:**\n\n1. Having a balanced presence on both press releases and social media platforms is essential for effective communication and engagement with the audience.\n2. Collaborations and product developments are key strategic priorities for companies like Blackstone and Fidelity Investments, highlighting the importance of innovation and partnerships in the competitive landscape.\n3. Leveraging social media platforms can enhance visibility and engagement with the audience, as seen in the case of BlackRock and Fidelity Investments.\n\n**Recommended Actions:**\n\n1. J.P. Morgan Asset Management should consider ramping up its social media presence to improve visibility and engagement with its audience.\n2. Goldman Sachs Private Wealth should consider increasing its press releases to maintain market visibility and stay competitive in the industry.\n3. Companies should continue to focus on collaborations, innovative product developments, and effective communication strategies to stay ahead of the competition.\n\n**Risk Assessment:**\n\n1. Lack of social media presence can result in reduced visibility and engagement with the audience, impacting brand awareness and market positioning.\n2. Insufficient press releases may lead to a lack of communication with stakeholders, potentially affecting market perception and competitiveness.\n\n**Opportunities Identified:**\n\n1. Companies can explore strategic partnerships and collaborations to enhance product offerings and market presence.\n2. Leveraging social media platforms can help in increasing brand visibility, engagement, and communication with the target audience.", prompt_type: nil, response_time_ms: nil, tokens_used: nil, model_used: nil, metadata: %{}, is_regenerated: false, conversation_id: 8, conversation: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :conversation is not loaded>, parent_message_id: nil, parent_message: nil, child_messages: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :child_messages is not loaded>, inserted_at: ~N[2025-07-29 13:00:05], updated_at: ~N[2025-07-29 13:00:05]}, %DashboardGen.Conversations.ConversationMessage{__meta__: #Ecto.Schema.Metadata<:loaded, "conversation_messages">, id: 20, role: "user", content: "what is 2+2", prompt_type: nil, response_time_ms: nil, tokens_used: nil, model_used: nil, metadata: %{}, is_regenerated: false, conversation_id: 8, conversation: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :conversation is not loaded>, parent_message_id: nil, parent_message: nil, child_messages: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :child_messages is not loaded>, inserted_at: ~N[2025-07-31 13:10:40], updated_at: ~N[2025-07-31 13:10:40]}, %DashboardGen.Conversations.ConversationMessage{__meta__: #Ecto.Schema.Metadata<:loaded, "conversation_messages">, id: 21, role: "user", content: "Analyze BlackRock's recent strategy", prompt_type: nil, response_time_ms: nil, tokens_used: nil, model_used: nil, metadata: %{}, is_regenerated: false, conversation_id: 8, conversation: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :conversation is not loaded>, parent_message_id: nil, parent_message: nil, child_messages: #Ecto.Association.NotLoaded<association :child_messages is not l